            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               SubframeQualityReview: Adds R4 rank-of-ranks scoring, always-visible R3 rankings, and optional corner scoring. Reorganizes review details into a shared collapsible section and expands the R4 documentation with a worked example.
